{
    "pr_body": "Fix https://github.com/elastic/elasticsearch/issues/104393.\r\n\r\nFor any descendants of `EsqlConfigurationFunction`, the `hashCode` and `equals` methods did not take the actual configuration into account. It is important that they do, since functions like `NOW` provide different results depending on the configuration; in particular, the actual `now` datetime is contained in the `EsqlConfiguration`.\r\n\r\nAlso, clean redundant implementations of `hashCode` and `equals` in other functions, whenever the inherited methods could just be used.\r\nI went over all inheritors of `EsqlScalarFunction` for this.",
    "original_commit_id": "98ed236f2bd58c0c3460a77493b231fd37a05cb9",
    "merged": true,
    "pr_number": 107947,
    "pr_title": "ESQL: Fix equals hashCode for functions",
